---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
import { platformText } from "./platform";
import "./platform-controls.css";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang),
  p = platformText(lang);
---

<section
  data-demo="canary"
  data-platform
  lang={lang}
  data-reset-message={p.resetMessage}
>
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">{p.simulation}</p>
    <h2>{t("Canary evaluation", "카나리 평가", "カナリア評価")}</h2>
  </header>
  <p>
    {t(
      "Synthetic samples: 1,000 requests in each cohort. These matched sample counts do not specify the traffic split.",
      "가상 표본: 각 집단 요청 1,000건. 동일한 표본 수는 트래픽 배분 비율이 아닙니다.",
      "仮の標本：各群1,000件。同数の標本は配信比率を表しません。",
    )}
  </p>
  <div class="controls">
    <button type="button" data-previous disabled>
      {p.previous}
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-next disabled>
      {p.next}
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-reset data-interactive disabled>
      {p.reset}
    </button>
  </div>
  <label>
    <input type="checkbox" data-empty-samples data-interactive disabled />
    {t("No samples", "표본 없음", "標本なし")}
  </label>
  <ol class="timeline">
    <li data-stage="0">{t("Read counts", "집계 읽기", "件数を読む")}</li>
    <li data-stage="1">
      {t("Compute error rates", "오류율 계산", "エラー率を計算")}
    </li>
    <li data-stage="2">
      {t("Evaluate stop rule", "중단 규칙 평가", "停止規則を評価")}
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="cohorts">
    <section>
      <h3>v1 · {t("Control", "대조군", "対照群")}</h3>
      <p>{t("Errors / requests", "오류 / 요청", "エラー / リクエスト")}</p>
      <strong data-control-sample>2 / 1,000</strong>
      <p data-control-rate>—</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>v2 · {t("Candidate", "후보", "候補")}</h3>
      <p>{t("Errors / requests", "오류 / 요청", "エラー / リクエスト")}</p>
      <strong data-canary-sample>30 / 1,000</strong>
      <p data-canary-rate>—</p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="gate">
    <h3>
      {t(
        "Example stop rule: candidate errors > 1%",
        "예제 중단 규칙: 후보 오류율 > 1%",
        "例の停止規則：候補のエラー率 > 1%",
      )}
    </h3>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Zero samples → insufficient evidence, never a pass. Not a universal threshold.",
        "표본 0건 → 판단 불가. 통과 아님. 보편적 기준이 아닙니다.",
        "標本0件 → 判断不能。合格ではありません。普遍的な基準ではありません。",
      )}
    </p>
    <p data-decision>{p.waiting}</p>
  </div>
  <p class="current" data-current>
    {t("Read counts", "집계 읽기", "件数を読む")}
  </p>
  <p data-traffic>
    {t(
      "v1: control · v2: limited exposure; no expansion",
      "v1: 대조군 · v2: 제한 노출, 확대 없음",
      "v1：対照群 · v2：限定公開、拡大なし",
    )}
  </p>
  <aside class="data">
    <h3>{t("Data lane", "데이터 영역", "データ領域")}</h3>
    <p>{p.compatible}</p>
  </aside>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
</section>
<script>
  import { mountCanary } from "./release-behavior";
  mountCanary();
</script>
<style>
  section {
    background: #f3f6fb;
    color: #172640;
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 30px);
    border: 1px solid #8696ad;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #aab7c9;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .data {
    padding: 18px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    border: 3px double #496552;
    background: #e9f2ed;
  }
  .current {
    padding: 16px;
    border-left: 4px solid #395882;
    background: #e1eaf8;
  }
  .timeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 0;
    list-style-position: inside;
  }
  .timeline li {
    padding: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #8493aa;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 120px;
  }
  .metrics {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .cohorts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .cohorts section {
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid #7888a0;
  }
  .cohorts strong {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .gate {
    padding: 18px;
    border: 2px dashed #875534;
    background: #fff1e5;
  }
  @container (max-width:560px) {
    .cohorts {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
